      {
        "content": "The last sailing has been cancelled. A shuttered ticket window faces empty benches. LENA, the clerk, numbers a paper envelope 17 and slides a brass locker key inside. Her left thumb wears a fresh white bandage. TOM, her younger brother, sets a blue insulated medicine case on the counter.",
