        "element_type": "character"
      },
      {
        "content": "Dad's doses. The clinic launch comes at six. Don't leave this in the locker.",
        "element_type": "dialogue"
      },
      {
        "content": "Lena puts the envelope in her coat and the case beneath the counter. Through frosted glass, a COURIER in an orange rain cape knocks twice. Only a silhouette is visible.",
